   658	| Code | Meaning |
   659	|---|---|
   660	| 0 | success |
   661	| 1 | any other error (an RFC 9457 problem is printed), including `E_SQLITE_TOO_OLD`, `E_TZ_REQUIRED`, `E_CASE_LOCKED`, `E_DB_*` and `E_SCHEMA_MISSING` |
