   664	| 4 | partial: some records ended in quarantine or a skip. The counts are printed and recorded |
   665	
   666	- **Command tree.** The contact can also come from `--contact-file` or a prompt, so names do not land in shell history (chatgpt F31).
   667	
   668	```
   669	chatx case       create [--encrypt] | status | verify | repair | resume | backup | delete-source | purge | import-bundle
   670	chatx import     imessage [--db PATH | --from-backup DIR] [--contact ... | --contact-file F] [--probe] [--resume]
