| AST-F30 | HIGH | CONFIRMED | packet:L274 | [S9,S12] X1's recorded run cannot simultaneously be the final-commit run and its predecessor as instructed. | L274 says the final commit's URL is recorded, then says the recorded URL is for the preceding commit; L78 queries only the latest run, and L276 adds further commits. | Define tested_sha, record_commit_sha, immutable run ID/attempt/URL and release_tag_sha separately, select runs by exact identity, and provide a final receipt that does not require self-referential commits. |
