| AST-F19 | HIGH | CONFIRMED | packet:L245 | [S4,S13] Exact action tags are treated as immutable pins. | L245/B3 request exact tags; Stop S7 bans floating tags, but version tags can still move; [GitHub recommends full commit SHAs](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/secure-use). | Pin every action and reusable third-party workflow to a verified full commit SHA, retain its human-readable release/date, and check organization allow-list compatibility. |
